{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Nkn69mt0lK1792963925.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>委內瑞拉反對派領袖馬查多，流亡10個月後回國。</p><p></p><p>馬查多星期日在委內瑞拉巴基西梅托市一座教堂內現身，眾多支持者跟她擁抱。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VEN.MACHADO-0400.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026djJ0JZ5qJF1792963934.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>馬查多較早時在社交平台發帖文說，「我在這裡，跟你們同在」，並且感謝美國總統特朗普及國務卿魯比奧的支持。不過她沒有透露，是如何返回委內瑞拉。特朗普則表示，對馬查多回國不知情。另一名反對派領袖目前身在西班牙的岡薩雷斯，在社交平台發帖文指，他本人亦會於短期內回國。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VEN.MACHADO-0400_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hhkjQ7gGvQ1792963922.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>馬查多去年12月秘密逃離委內瑞拉，今年1月總統馬杜羅被美國俘虜及強行送到紐約，羅德里格斯出任代理總統至今。雖然羅德里格斯擔任代理總統已經超越法定期限，但政府至今仍然未安排總統選舉。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41.271353+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T21:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.132880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.906869+00:00","content_hash":"539cff824267ec49764fc920f49134035e1d701bc356afaa7b055e3e974c4293","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41.271353+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}